            "step_label": "2009",
            "sub_heading": "The start of the journey",
            "heading": "Meet The Honey Man",
            "description": "<p>I’m Riath, better known as the <strong>“Honey Man”</strong>—a title earned through my unwavering passion for raw, unadulterated honey. With Yemeni roots and born in South Yorkshire, I grew up savouring the rich, golden nectar my parents brought back from their homeland—a taste so pure, it became a lifelong obsession. But when I searched for the same authenticity in the market, I found only disappointment. That frustration sparked a mission: <strong>to bring the world’s finest raw honey to those who crave the real thing.</strong> And so, Balqees was born—a journey to champion purity, tradition, and the incredible flavours of raw honey, straight from the source.</p>",
            "url": "",
            "btn_label": "Read more",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        },
