            "step_label": "",
            "sub_heading": "The Signature Honey",
            "heading": "Yemeni Sidr",
            "description": "<p>This honey was the one i grew up on. Savouring that rich butterscotch taste for the first time in my life was a transformative experience which would later inspire me to search for it once more. Many types of raw honey have health and medicinal qualities, but Sidr Honey in particular has an abundance of minerals, vitamins and other nutrients which makes it even more potent.</p>",
            "url": "",
            "btn_label": "Read more",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
